*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.proto text eol=lf
# Default every text file to LF in the working tree, not just the extensions listed
# above. The per-extension pins were incomplete -- *.proto was missing, so a Windows
# clone checked the three proto files out as CRLF and computed a DIFFERENT architecture
# checksum from the same commit (Architecture_Freeze.md section 8.3). Enumerating
# extensions loses that race every time a new one appears; defaulting closes the class.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.onnx binary
*.bin binary
*.wav binary
